From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: athexweb3 <athexweb3@nirapod.org>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 18:01:42 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] Changelog entry for the system call vector register fix

---
 changes/02-bugfix/1640-syscall-vector-registers.md | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 changes/02-bugfix/1640-syscall-vector-registers.md

diff --git a/changes/02-bugfix/1640-syscall-vector-registers.md b/changes/02-bugfix/1640-syscall-vector-registers.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..ebda7134
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changes/02-bugfix/1640-syscall-vector-registers.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+- System calls (e.g., `#randombytes`) are no longer assumed to preserve the
+  vector registers. Under `-call-conv windows`, an export function that issues
+  a system call now saves and restores `ymm6` to `ymm15`, and a vector value
+  can no longer stay in a register across a system call
+  ([PR #1640](https://github.com/jasmin-lang/jasmin/pull/1640)).
